                "description": "Eden Prairie Egg Knob With Parthenon Plate Grandeur PAREDN - Grandeur's Eden Prairie Knob With Parthenon Plate is the perfect combination of masculine and feminine, simple and ornate. Made out of solid brass, this knobset features a classic design that is slightly floral while the beading around the perimeter keeps it from being too soft. The Eden Prairie's egg shape is timeless, its simple design allowing that of the Parthenon Rose to shine. This Grandeur Parthenon Plate With Eden Prairie Knob includes a high fits It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
